# The C/C++ pack's glue and what no unit builds with: glue.sh and what it
# bundles (the workers' sources under src/, which a unit may also name in
# its paths), the pack's tests and their fixtures, and its documents. An
# edit to any of these rebuilds no toolchain; it is assembled in seconds.
glue.paths
glue.sh
glue-lib.sh
build.sh
compress.mjs
package.json
package-lock.json
README.md
src/
test*.mjs
tests/
vm/README.md
vm/fixtures/
vm/.shellcheckrc
